  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">E-f&#xf6;rvaltning i Ukraina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egovernance in Ukraine - Egovenance in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektkonceptet om en &#xf6;ppen och serviceinriktad administration som   anv&#xe4;nder e-f&#xf6;rvaltning p&#xe5; var och en av de administrativa niv&#xe5;erna    (region, distrikt och lokal niv&#xe5;) skulle kunna bli en modell f&#xf6;r      myndigheter hos andra l&#xe4;nsadministrationer och organ f&#xf6;r lokalt       sj&#xe4;lvstyre i Ukraina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project concept of an open and service-oriented government that   uses the schemes of e-government at each of the three levels of       government (regional, district and local) could become a model for    the authorities of other administrations and local self-government    bodies in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
